SUMMARY:Adelaide MedTech Hackathon 2026 – Day 1: Idea Generation
LOCATION:Adelaide Health and Medical Sciences (AHMS), North Terrace, Adelaide SA 5000, Australia
DESCRIPTION:🩺 Adelaide MedTech Hackathon 2026\n\nJoin students, innovators, clinicians and industry mentors over four exciting days to develop innovative healthcare solutions. Work in multidisciplinary teams, receive expert mentoring, learn startup and innovation skills, and pitch your idea for the chance to win prizes.\n\n🌐 Website: https://adelaidemedtech.com\n🎟 Register: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfzuxnYnfdkLhnjFOCKnJlDzZ1v4SgjJFXPof3jKiJ0IE3-Mw/viewform\n🍕 Dinner provided\n💰 Free event\n🎒 Bring your laptop and charger\n📧 Questions: adelaide.medtechhackathon@gmail.com\n\nToday's focus:\n- Meet your team\n- Brainstorm ideas\n- Validate your problem\n- Plan your solution
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT1H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Adelaide MedTech Hackathon 2026 – Day 1: Idea Generation starts in 1 hour
END:VALARM
